//RS /// hand-written `core.regex` branch has widened since ec4c9c460, but the
//RS /// registry path runs first and shadows it, which is how a real fix coexisted
//RS /// with a live bug — so the fixture must go through `re.flags`, not a
//RS /// hand-lowered spelling.
